All final slides are rendered through PowerPoint and inspected individually. The finalizer checks package integrity, slide geometry, preserved Segoe UI text, editable backup tables and first-party import. Sources and notes remain embedded. The notebook validator separately retains its existing Paper2Agent missing-rev9 link errors; that older project remains unchanged.

To rebuild, run the builder with the bundled Python runtime, finalize to a fresh output revision, then render and inspect that exact file. The finalizer preserves existing outputs. Historical builder/notes snapshots are under `history/rev2/`.

## Value-first order

Moved the former slide 5 to slide 2 on 2026-10-23. The former slides 2–4 are now slides 3–5. All other slides retain their order. Content, native shape/style XML, notes and timing match the prior deck, apart from updated slide numbers. The prior deck is retained under `history/rev3-before-value-first/`.
